// Rink plugin — the calculator, replacing rofi-calc.
//
// No prefix: typing "1920/16+7" answers directly, exactly as rofi-calc did.
// That is the whole point of the switch — rofi-calc cannot evaluate inside
// rofi's combi mode (upstream issue #33, open since 2019), which is what made
// the previous setup need a separate entry just to reach the calculator.
//
// `prefix` is the ONLY field this plugin reads (see plugins/rink/src/lib.rs in
// anyrun v26.6.1: `struct Config { prefix: String }`). Unit and currency
// conversion therefore come entirely from rink itself — "5 km to miles",
// "20 usd in eur" — and the plugin refreshes its currency table
// unconditionally at startup; there is no option to disable that here.

Config(
    prefix: "",
)
